space from names.\n2. Deduped on email + plot + join date (Bram duplicate removed).\n3. Coerced `fee_paid_cad` to float (blanks → 0, `45` → 45.00).\n4. Summed `fee_paid_cad` per unique member; the Sabela pair nets to 0.\n5. Cross-checked by manual tally above — matches programmatic sum.", "tokens": {"input": 9568, "output": 3307, "total": 12875, "cache_read": 0, "cache_write": 0}, "duration_ms": 175669, "timestamp": 1794672377623}
